Hi Ronaldo,

I joined this mailing list for exactly this reason when I first learned 
about JGR - I think a "Run line and go to next line" shortcut is greatly 
missed!

I use emacs and ESS for myself where this is the most used command. 
However, everytime I help people with R they need to use a windows 
version, and I think the standard windows gui still has a lot to wish 
for. JGR fills this gap, but it misses an easy way to run through the 
lines in your script.

Now we are at it, I think a great shortcut is "Run section and go to 
next section" where a section is a group of lines not separated by a 
blank line.

Best regards,
Stig

