On Mar 21, 2009, at 15:09 , Abdel wrote:

> Hi Simon,
>
> On http://www.rforge.net/Rserve/ you said :
> ------
> As a side note - if you are looking just for a way to access R from  
> Java in one
> application without the need for the client/server concept, you may  
