I don't quite understand the question - both Rserve and rJava are  
platform independent (in theory Rserve more so since it doesn't  
require Java, but we are discussing Java here so in that sense they  
are equal).


> By the way, is there another possibility to access R from java while  
> preserving code portability ?

The REngine API is now implemented by both rJava/JRI and Rserve so  
code portability is preserved while you use either of them. I don't  
know of any other project using the same API.

Cheers,
Simon

